<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" style="" color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><img src="https://qantas--qisdev--c.cs72.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0155D000000DKDY&amp;oid=00D5D000000CovB" border="0" align="left" alt=""></span><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" style="" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 12pt;">Hi {!Case.Contact},</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666">Thank you for contacting Qantas Corporate Sales.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666" style=""><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666" style="">Your Qantas Business Rewards Flight Report includes details of flights purchased on&nbsp;</font><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">qantas.com</span><font face="arial" color="#666666" style="">&nbsp;that have your ABN added. The reports are based on transaction (booking) month.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666">The booking [XXXXXXX] has not been include in your report as [ABN was not included/ the booking was made with a Travel Agent].</font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666" style=""><font style="">The ABN can entered on&nbsp;</font></font><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">qantas.com</span><font face="arial" color="#666666" style=""><font style="">&nbsp;when making a new booking (during the Passenger details stage) or as a Qantas Business Rewards Customer you can make your booking via </font><a href="http://www.qantas.com/travel/airlines/business-direct/global/en" style=""><font color="#666666">Qantas Business Rewards</font></a><font style="">. This will automatically add the ABN into each new booking, as well as assisting with managing your travel</font><font style="">.&nbsp;</font></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666" style=""><font style="">Should you wish to add the ABN into any upcoming flights this can be done via</font><font style=""> </font><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en.html?tabId=manage-booking" style=""><font color="#666666">Manage Booking</font></a><font style="">.</font></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666">Unfortunately the ABN cannot be added to bookings flown bookings.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666" style="">Please let me know if there was another booking reference you would like us to investigate or alternative you contact us on 13 10 85.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" style="" color="#666666">Kind regards,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Qantas Corporate Sales</span></div><div><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Airways Limited</font></div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020</font></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666">P.&nbsp; 13 10 85 Ext 36</font></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666">E.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="mailto:corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au"><font color="#666666">corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au</font></a></font></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--qisdev--c.cs72.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0155D000000DJcN&amp;oid=00D5D000000CovB" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size: 7pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: silver;">Qantas Privacy Notice<br></span></b><span style="font-size: 7pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: silver;">Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13 10 85.</span></p></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>